.TH CF 1
.SH NAME
cfhub \- Cloudflare administration CLI
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B cfhub
<resource> <action> [options]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Use cfhub for Cloudflare resources, audits, inventory, and raw API calls. API-token and OAuth profiles are supported.
.SH EXAMPLES
.B cfhub auth status
.br
.B cfhub zone list --json
.br
.B cfhub api /zones --json --jq '.result[].name'
.SH SEE ALSO
cfhub --help
